<br/><a name="backendencryption"/><h1>Back-End Encryption and Secure Authentication</h1>

<p>SQL Relay also supports TLS/SSL Encryption and Authentication between the SQL Relay server and some databases.</p>

<p>The configuration details differ between databases though.</p>

<ul>
  <li><a href="secbackendoracle.html">Oracle</a></li>
  <li><a href="secbackendmssql.html">Microsoft SQL Server (via FreeTDS)</a></li>
  <li><a href="secbackendmysql.html">MySQL/MariaDB</a></li>
  <li><a href="secbackendpostgresql.html">PostgreSQL</a></li>
</ul>

